# Redistribution

When distributing Usoftech Framework with its third-party dependencies:

1. Keep the original third-party license files.
2. Keep required copyright notices.
3. Do not claim third-party software as Usoftech code.
4. Do not remove attribution required by a third-party license.
5. Check `composer.lock` before each release to identify the exact
   dependency set.
6. Check frontend asset directories for their original license and
   attribution files.
7. Update this document when dependencies are added, removed or changed.

The `LICENSE` file in the root of this repository applies to the
Usoftech Framework code itself.

Third-party software remains governed by its respective licenses.

